        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "School Survey on Crime and Safety (SSOCS)",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "SSOCS follows a nationally representative kindergarten cohort from 2010 through fifth grade. It supports weighted descriptive and developmental context; it does not by itself estimate an initiative’s effect.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "412ff593e9154012a43d4c27ec5c68b6"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "https://nces.ed.gov/surveys/ssocs/",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "6a045d705aaf4a09bb8e8bfabf006f5f"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "SSOCS catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** National Center for Education Statistics.\n- **Access:** Public-use custom extracts through NCES DataLab; restricted-use files require a license.\n- **Unit:** Sampled public school, cross-sectional.\n- **Coverage:** 19992000 onward; use the cycle-specific public-use release.\n- **Geography:** Nation and selected states.\n- **Join keys:** Student record, wave, permitted school record, and survey weight.\n- **Measures:** Incidents, discipline, safety policies, security, and mental-health and restorative supports.\n- **Appropriate uses:** School climate, discipline, and safety-implementation context.\n\nUse NCES weights and cohort-specific documentation. Public-use identifiers are suppressed, and SSOCS is observational longitudinal data, so causal initiative evaluation requires a separate credible design.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
